# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Run artefacts.
# Worksheets are the product, and they concern the systems you actually evaluate
# — often client work or unreleased models. The scaffold stays tracked so a fresh
# clone is usable; the runs themselves do not leave your machine.
#
# Note this keeps worksheets/_index/log.md tracked, which carries one line per run
# (slug, mode, subject). Keep subjects terse, or ignore the log too if even that
# is too much: add `worksheets/_index/log.md` below.
worksheets/*/
!worksheets/_index/

# Orchestration backend: session transcripts, never committed
.sessions/
_server/.venv/

# Your Anthropic API key. `.env.example` is the tracked copy — the real one
# never is.
.env
!.env.example

# Python cache files
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Brainstorming visual companion (superpowers skill scratch space)
.superpowers/
